'''Ritual Happiness''' (召喚された福！, ''Shōkan Sareta Suku!'', '''Summoned Fortune!''') is the February event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.1 Update#Version 2.1.2 Update|Version 2.1.2]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Ritual Happiness'''}} is back in the Battle Cats! Visit the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Legend Stages'''}} to challenge the fates and test your good fortune!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available February 1st (11:00am) thru March 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Get a chance to unlock {{Color|#0000FF|'''Evil Cat'''}} upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|100%}} chance to collect rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|Treasure Radar item}}!)

※ After you have picked up Evil Cat, unlock it at the {{Color|#34A853|Rare Cats}} section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Evil Cat from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

